	I have the source for the original hack by the original author, Jay
Fenalson.  This is the hack without the dog, etc., but it does have such
nifty features as moving walls and tough monsters.  This is the PC version
requiring 128K.  To compile it, you will need Lattice C 2.15 and some kind
of Macro Assembler.

	Modifying the source is hard.  The code is very ugly (to prevent
modifications).  If you see something in the code that is in bad taste
(style/method wise) it is probably to prevent people from cheating or from
changing the executable.

	If you still want all 281K of ARC'ed source, let me know and I will
e-mail it to you.  No, I will not post it, no matter what the demand, :->.

